and bacteria in the air and provide clean and healthy indoor air.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Healthcare facilities<\/strong>: In places such as hospitals, laboratories and pharmaceutical plants, bag air filters are used in sensitive environments such as clean rooms, operating rooms and laboratories to ensure that the air is free of bacteria, viruses and other contaminants.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Electronics industry<\/strong>: In the semiconductor manufacturing and electronic assembly processes, bag air filters are used to remove tiny particles in the air to ensure the cleanliness of the production process and avoid damage to electronic components by tiny particles.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Food and beverage manufacturing<\/strong>: During food and beverage processing, bag air filters are used to keep the production environment clean, prevent dust, bacteria and other contaminants from entering the product, and ensure product safety and quality.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Energy industry<\/strong>: In energy production fields such as power plants and petrochemical plants, bag air filters are used to remove particulate matter produced during the combustion process and reduce air pollution.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4450\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-01-detail2-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"142\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-01-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-01-detail2.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 214px) 100vw, 214px\" \/> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4451\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Application-of-Pocket-Air-Filter-02-detail3-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"143\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads